Diwi
$cards
DECK 2 SPADES

$initial
COLUMN 10 FACE_HALF
COLUMN 0 FACE_HALF
COLUMN 6 FACE_ALL

AHAIP 7 FACE_LAST
AHAIP 3 FACE_LAST

